{"version":1,"content":"<p>一名22歲菲律賓女子涉嫌販毒，昨日在機場被捕。</p><p>涉案女子昨日從柬埔寨金邊飛抵本港，海關為她進行清關時，在其寄艙行李內檢獲約6公斤可卡因，市值約360萬元。</p><p>她已被控一項販運危險藥物罪，明日在西九龍裁判法院提堂。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T00:47:50.098200+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":105,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-01T07:09:47+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T07:38:23.462305+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T00:41:26.768580+00:00","content_hash":"7c2d43951452efe35f6462305c66d471246107d795e795cf50c7d12a69d41e5c","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}